k_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- 4.6.beta1\n- 4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\nI don't know if it is a documentation or a build system issue, but a production build for the Android editor with:\n```cmd\nscons platform=android arch=arm64 production=yes swappy=true target=editor generate_android_binaries=yes\n```\nDoesn't output an `android_editor-release.apk` like the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.html#installing-the-godot-editor-apk) claims. It outputs multiple debug binaries instead.\n\n```\nandroid_editor-android-debug.aab\nandroid_editor-android-debug.apk\nandroid_editor-horizonos-debug.aab\nandroid_editor-horizonos-debug.apk\nandroid_editor-picoos-debug.aab\nandroid_editor-picoos-debug.apk\n```\n\nThis can also be observed in the CI logs for `Android / Editor (target=editor)`. It builds with `production=yes` flag, but it outputs these debug binaries.\n\nCompilation:\n```\nRun ./.github/actions/godot-build\n  with:\n    scons-flags: dev_mode=yes module_text_server_fb_enabled=yes tests=no swappy=yes arch=arm64 production=yes\n```\nGenerate Godot editor\n```\nBUILD SUCCESSFUL in 32s\n99 actionable tasks: 57 executed, 42 up-to-date\ntotal 695044\n-rw-r--r-- 1 runner runner  77075822 Dec 12 20:27 android_editor-android-debug.aab\n-rw-r--r-- 1 runner runner 163887442 Dec 12 20:27 android_editor-android-debug.apk\n-rw-r--r-- 1 runner runner  74802175 Dec 12 20:28 android_editor-horizonos-debug.aab\n-rw-r--r-- 1 runner runner 156850809 Dec 12 20:28 android_editor-horizonos-debug.apk\n-rw-r--r-- 1 runner runner  74798676 Dec 12 20:28 android_editor-picoos-debug.aab\n-rw-r--r-- 1 runner runner 164279546 Dec 12 20:28 android_editor-picoos-debug.apk\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nBuild using:\n```cmd\nscons platform=android arch=arm64 production=yes swappy=true target=editor generate_android_binaries=yes\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"mhilbrunner","id":1654763,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTQ3NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1654763?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner","html_url":"https://github.com/mhilbrunner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113958/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113958/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}